editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md:381:- Karis (B7 edition `chapter-57.md:99`; `chapter-60.md:251`): `Three points make a line. Four make an argument.` / `Someone made this pattern.` [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: amendment 8]
