   884	
   885	**The watch.** Seven, hooded, faceless, unnamed, one with a Path that throws light. It saw: a big man take two bolts on Iron; a Force put a barricade a body's length; five people cross the iron, walk sixty strides inside it, and stand; an old man on a stick among them. **It saw nothing work inside the line, and no light, crack or named thing from either crew.** Nobody was killed or taken. It went east.
